*> arithmetic_compute.cbl -- demonstrates: COMPUTE for arithmetic
*> expressions, including a PIC clause with an implied decimal point
*> (V99) for a price field.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ARITHCOMPUTE.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-UNIT-PRICE   PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE 12.50.
01  WS-QUANTITY     PIC 9(4)    VALUE 3.
01  WS-TOTAL-PRICE  PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 0.
01  WS-SCORE-1      PIC 9(3)    VALUE 80.
01  WS-SCORE-2      PIC 9(3)    VALUE 90.
01  WS-SCORE-3      PIC 9(3)    VALUE 100.
01  WS-AVERAGE      PIC 9(3)    VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    COMPUTE WS-TOTAL-PRICE = WS-UNIT-PRICE * WS-QUANTITY.
    DISPLAY "TOTAL PRICE: " WS-TOTAL-PRICE.

    COMPUTE WS-AVERAGE = (WS-SCORE-1 + WS-SCORE-2 + WS-SCORE-3) / 3.
    DISPLAY "AVERAGE SCORE: " WS-AVERAGE.
    STOP RUN.
